":"adjective","partOfSpeechKo":"형용사","definitionKo":"모양이나 방향, 위치가 곧거나 바르지 않고 한쪽으로 기울거나 쏠려 있다.","englishExpression":"slanted; tilted; crooked","englishDescription":"A shape, direction, or position being not straight, but inclining or leaning to one side.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=61959&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:67125:1","headword":"어슷하다","partOfSpeech":"adjective","partOfSpeechKo":"형용사","definitionKo":"한쪽으로 조금 비뚤다.","englishExpression":"slanted; tilted","englishDescription":"A bit crooked to one side.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=67125&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:88403:1","headword":"기우뚱기우뚱하다","partOfSpeech":"adjective","partOfSpeechKo":"형용사","definitionKo":"여러 물체가 한쪽으로 조금 기울어져 있다.","englishExpression":"slanted","englishDescription":"Several objects being slightly tilted to one side.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=88403&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:91436:1","headword":"갸우뚱갸우뚱하다","partOfSpeech":"adjective","partOfSpeechKo":"형용사","definitionKo":"여럿이 다 한쪽으로 약간 기울어져 있다.","englishExpression":"inclined; slanted","englishDescription":"All of several things being slightly tilted to one side.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=91436&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:91439:1","headword":"갸웃갸웃하다","partOfSpeech":"adjective","partOfSpeechKo":"형용사","definitionKo":"여럿이 다 한쪽으로 조금 기울어져 있다.","englishExpression":"inclined; slanted","englishDescription":"All of several things being slightly tilted to one side.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=91439&nation=eng&nationCode=6"}],"state":[{"id":"krdict:14182:3","headword":"꼴","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"(낮잡아 이르는 말로) 어떤 형편이나 상황.","englishExpression":"state","englishDescription":"(disparaging) A certain state or situation.","sourceUrl":"h