r.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62603&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:67205:1","headword":"언급하다","partOfSpeech":"verb","partOfSpeechKo":"동사","definitionKo":"어떤 일이나 문제에 대해 말하다.","englishExpression":"mention; state; talk about","englishDescription":"To talk about a certain matter or problem.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=67205&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:67243:1","headword":"양태","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"어떤 모양이나 상태.","englishExpression":"look; state; manifestation; pattern","englishDescription":"A certain form or state.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=67243&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:72389:1","headword":"표시하다","partOfSpeech":"verb","partOfSpeechKo":"동사","definitionKo":"의견이나 감정 등을 겉으로 드러내 보이다.","englishExpression":"express; state","englishDescription":"To show one's opinion, feeling, etc., outwardly.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=72389&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:75648:1","headword":"정태","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"어떤 일의 사정과 상태.","englishExpression":"state","englishDescription":"The situation and state of a particular affair.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=75648&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:76827:1","headword":"진술하다","partOfSpeech":"verb","partOfSpeechKo":"동사","definitionKo":"일이나 상황에 대해 의견을 자세히 이야기하다.","englishExpression":"state","englishDescription":"To give one's opinion on a certain topic or situation in a detailed manner.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=76827&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:83617:2","headword":"푼수","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"상태나 형편.","englishExpression":"situation; state","englishDescription":"One's situation 